── UNKNOWN NAME ───────────────────────── E0211_javascript_this.lt:4:26  [E0211]

Stilt names the receiver `self`, not `this`:

  4 │   fn next(self) -> i64 { this.count + 1 }
    │                          ^^^^

A method takes its receiver as its first parameter, `self`, and reads its fields
as `self.x`.

To fix it, write `self`:

  4 │   fn next(self) -> i64 { self.count + 1 }
    │                          ~~~~
